{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15746","headline":"送程秀才 · 司空曙","name":"送程秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠多路岐，相见又别离。\n东风催节换，焰焰春阳散。\n楚草渐烟绵，江云亦芜漫。\n送子恨何穷，故关如梦中。\n游人尽还北，旅雁辞南国。\n枫树几回青，逐臣归不得。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15746.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15746","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}